mocrat  but also believes in stringent  immigration checks someone  supports biden and also accuses his  policies of causing a tsunami of  wokeness  flooding across america before the what  about isms appear in your brain  i'm not saying that any of these stances  are even slightly incompatible  there will be lots of people who  actually have those blends of beliefs  but  very few of them ever appear in  discussions online  and anyone who does is immediately  destroyed  why is that firstly having a non-typical  perspective on an element of  your group's ideology is often seen by  the other side  as weakness or a lack of conviction it's  seen as a signal that you're actually an  uneducated hypocrite  who doesn't know what they're supposed  to believe it's much safer  to go out all guns blazing with the most  extreme views possible  leaving no chinks in the armor secondly  having a non-typical perspective is seen  by  your side as a lack of commitment and  identification with the shared values of  your own group  if you disagree with us on this topic  then what else can't we trust you about  it's much safer  for people to avoid bringing attention  to themselves by holding a nuance view  so they just adopt the group ideology  wholesale having a balanced viewpoint  essentially just makes you an unreliable  ally and this  is weaponized by a third element that  the internet is just a hyper-vigilant  hypocrisy dunk fest  especially on twitter all that most  people are there for is to find a  self-contradiction  closet racism or microaggression in  others online and then just highlight it  with the sharpest  most emotional language possible no one  is actually concerned with discovering  truth all they want is to look slick and  cool and to climb the state the ladder  by getting one over on someone else  my least favorite sentence on the  internet is because of your view  on issue x i can't take your opinion on  completely unrelated issue y  seriously and this is why everybody is  getting mad at sam at least when you're  out on the extremes you get agreement  from one side but when you're in the  middle  you guarantee disagreement from both on  a video i published about the capital  hill riots some people from both the  left and the right  consider the analysis unfair but for the  complete opposite reasons i even got a  reply this week  which literally suggested that a  balanced viewpoint is the opposite of  having a real opinion honestly  just bring on the robot overlords  because we here  i don't agree with everything sam says  but i trust him far more  because he has had to do lots of work to  arrive at his non-typical viewpoint we  all should be  incredibly skeptical of anyone who takes  that ideology wholesale if i know  one of your beliefs and from it i can  accurately predict  everything else that you believe then  you're not a serious person sam  consistently says  my mind is not made up on the specifics  and he suffers far more criticism for  being nuanced than he would for being an  absolutist so it's safe to presume  that he truly believes what he's saying  sam's benefit is that this independent  thought gives him a far deeper insight  into situations  because he can see both sides in my  opinion his can we pull back from the  brink podcast episode  around the blm protests last year was  the best  sense making anyone on earth did around  it being for  or against a thing does not mean that  you are universally  on side with the other people who are  also for or against it in 2021  the heaviest price is not paid by the  people out on the extremes  it's the moderates in the middle who get  hated by everyone the internet  only seems to have one emotional volume  now and it's 11. sadly that causes  people to retreat to these  boring tired repetitive tropes of  absolutist thinking  if you want to be a serious thinker you  need strong opinions  loosely held not loose opinions strongly  held you acquire wisdom  by disregarding group thing let me know  what you think in the comments below  and for more uncomfortable truths press  subscribe peace
 

